029400     .
029500* --- 2500-EDIT-CLAIM: CHECK MANDATORY FIELDS IN CLR.T_CLAIM
029600 2500-EDIT-CLAIM.
029700     IF CLM-CLAIM-ID = SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
029800        ADD 1 TO WS-REJECT-CNT
029900        MOVE 'CLAIM_ID MISSING' TO ERR-TEXT
030000     END-IF
030100     IF CLM-POLICY-NO = SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
030200        ADD 1 TO WS-REJECT-CNT
030300        MOVE 'POLICY_NO MISSING' TO ERR-TEXT
